{"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Add-the-package","text":"Add the package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". In ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"0.9.0\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links a binary framework, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which SwiftPM checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Register-the-wallet","text":"Register the wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleURLTypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"code":"issuerRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"verifierRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","text":"Provide the keys and the storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","text":"Implement the Wallet Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Create-the-wallet","text":"Create the wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots)","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","text":"Ship the release build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Next-steps","text":"Next steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"title":"Getting started","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, and create it at launch."}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingInPerson":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson","abstract":[{"text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval.","type":"text"}],"title":"Presenting in person","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}],"title":"WalletProvider","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"title":"platform","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"platform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Code"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message follows."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","abstract":[{"text":"NewWallet’s configuration.","type":"text"}],"title":"WalletConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GoingToProduction":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it."}],"title":"Going to production","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"title":"Handling errors","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helps without personal data."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"title":"holderAccessGroup","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"holderAccessGroup"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every key is in the default group."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ReceivingCredentials":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials","abstract":[{"text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and look after them once they’re held.","type":"text"}],"title":"Receiving credentials","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"title":"network","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"network"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Code"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"title":"Presenting from a link","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","abstract":[{"text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential store and Wallet Provider.","type":"text"}],"title":"Wallet","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store (the Secure Enclave). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":" WalletError."}],"title":"KeyStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform’s data protection. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"title":"CredentialStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","abstract":[{"text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"title":"FileCredentialStore","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"inAppGroup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Options"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A store in the app group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"type":"text","text":"’s container"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its extensions listing the group in their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.security.application-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement share."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingToSafari":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, as an iOS document provider."}],"title":"Presenting to Safari","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"title":"isTestBuild","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isTestBuild"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-tags mobiletest"},{"type":"text","text":"): an app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should refuse to run on it."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"}}}